Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:02:45 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1462/1463] HERESY 1559, 1561, 1562: the DAW draws pan, width
 and the sends over time; a strip's inserts (the Digital Gateway or a plugin's
 step, its result the new version) and the master's print; the chain on many
 takes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- heresy-mixer.js: the chip beside «A» (Vol, L–R, Wid, Rm, Dly), a knob drawn plays its line (panner, width gains, sends ramped), autos in the mix's value; refresh of the set's versions
- heresy-console.js: Insert in a strip's Input (the gateway's five characters, the plugins' file steps), Print in the master's devices (a pipeline: the set, the DAW's mix and versions, the gateway)
- heresy-post.js: «On the workspace…», the batch's line and Stop, a chain's body without a take; app.js: the Librarian's «Refine N with the chain»
- app.css, i18n ×11

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
